    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 'HSV ball-colour slider track: an Image stretched over the slider''s
        Background, sharing its rounded-rect material, with the matching ramp as
        its sprite. Hue = rainbow (drawn untinted), Value = black->white (tinted
        to the colour), Saturation = no sprite (tinted to the pure colour, with gradientOverlay
        on top).'
